/-!
# AME(6,2) for Formal Conjectures

A proof that an absolutely maximally entangled state of six qubits exists, against the
definitions of `FormalConjectures/OpenQuantumProblems/35.lean`. The witness is the six-qubit
prism graph state. The main result is `AME62.ame_6_2_exists` in `AME62/FormalTarget.lean`.
-/
